# 版本更新说明

## 6.8.0.300（2022-10-27）

|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本原子化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-foundation:6.8.0.300 Android版本原子化接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-extension:6.8.0.300 Android版本原子化接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-math:6.8.0.300 Android版本原子化接口UX包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-ux-ar:6.8.0.300 Android版本场景化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:sdk:6.8.0.300 Android版本场景化接口Full-SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:full-sdk:6.8.0.300 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-foundation:6.8.0.300 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-extension:6.8.0.300 Android版本2D流体模拟接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-iphysics-utils:6.8.0.300 **新增特性** * 新增线段形状类[EdgeShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-edgeshape-0000001365919424)。 * 新增[Body](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-body-0000001117457608)中绘制形状功能，新增接口[addEdgeShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-body-0000001117457608#section14685853102915)、[addCircleBorder](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-body-0000001117457608#section1680763623112)、[addRoundRectBorder](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-body-0000001117457608#section4418956352)、[getShapes](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-body-0000001117457608#section11584426384)。|

## SDK依赖说明

最新版原子化接口SDK主体包、2D流体模拟主体包、场景化接口SDK需要用户设备上安装HMS Core（APK）4.0.2.300及以上版本。

温馨提示：如果您在集成SDK或上架应用到华为应用市场时遇到问题，可以[在线提单](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/support/feedback/#/)。

## 历史版本

### 6.7.0.301（2022-09-15）

|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本原子化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-foundation:6.7.0.301 Android版本原子化接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-extension:6.7.0.301 Android版本原子化接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-math:6.7.0.301 Android版本原子化接口UX包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-ux-ar:6.7.0.301 Android版本场景化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:sdk:6.7.0.301 Android版本场景化接口Full-SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:full-sdk:6.7.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-foundation:6.7.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-extension:6.7.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-iphysics-utils:6.7.0.301 **新增特性** * 新增设置渲染件组件[Renderable](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-renderable-0000001061997748)描边高亮的功能，新增接口[SceneKit.RenderInfo](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-scenekit-renderinfo-0000001367013161)。 * 新增设置渲染件组件[Renderable](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-renderable-0000001061997748)材质透明，新增接口[BlendFunc](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-blendfunc-0000001367012925)。 * 升级targetSDKversion=33，以适配您的应用在Android13上正常运行。|

### 6.6.0.301（2022-07-08）

|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本原子化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-foundation:6.6.0.301 Android版本原子化接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-extension:6.6.0.301 Android版本原子化接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-math:6.6.0.301 Android版本原子化接口UX包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-ux-ar:6.6.0.301 Android版本场景化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:sdk:6.6.0.301 Android版本场景化接口Full-SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:full-sdk:6.6.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-foundation:6.6.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-extension:6.6.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-iphysics-utils:6.6.0.301 **新增特性** * 新增原子化接口3D流体组件，支持用户可交互的3D流体晃动效果。 * 新增3D流体类[FluidComponent](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-fluidcomponent-0000001304227669)、流体边界形状基类[SdfShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-scenekit-sdfshape-0000001303663901)、长方体流体边界形状类[SdfBoxShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-scenekit-sdfboxshape-0000001256143916)、圆柱体流体边界形状类[SdfCylinderShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-scenekit-sdfcylindershape-0000001303543901)、正四棱锥流体边界形状类[SdfPyramidShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-scenekit-sdfpyramidshape-0000001303423949)、球形流体边界形状类[SdfSphereShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-scenekit-sdfsphereshape-0000001303783905)。 * 新增[动态漫反射全局光照插件](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/ddgi-overview-0000001259716954)，提供更加自然的实时漫反射全局光照效果。|

### 6.2.0.300（2021-11-15）

|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本原子化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-foundation:6.2.0.300 Android版本原子化接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-extension:6.2.0.300 Android版本原子化接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-math:6.2.0.300 Android版本原子化接口UX包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-ux-ar:6.2.0.300 Android版本场景化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:sdk:6.2.0.300 Android版本场景化接口Full-SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:full-sdk:6.2.0.300 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-foundation:6.2.0.300 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-extension:6.2.0.300 Android版本2D流体模拟接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-iphysics-utils:6.2.0.300 Android版本3D人脸识别能力：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-ar-ml-extension:6.2.0.300 **新增特性** * 新增[高效遮挡剔除插件](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/good-culling-api-overview-0000001205509867)，用于查询场景中模型的遮挡关系。 * 更新[实时光追插件](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/rt-core-api-overview-0000001087364032)，新增细粒度着色器级别接口，便于开发集成，并提升接口性能。 * 预制<queries>配置，以实现您的应用在Android 11上运行时，正常调用HMS Core（APK）。您的开发环境必须满足[Android Studio](https://developer.android.com/studio) 3.6.1及以上版本、[Android Gradle插件](https://developer.android.com/studio/releases/gradle-plugin) 3.5.4及以上。|

### 6.0.0.301（2021-07-15）

|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本原子化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-foundation:6.0.0.301 Android版本原子化接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-render-extension:6.0.0.301 Android版本原子化接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-math:6.0.0.301 Android版本原子化接口UX包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-ux-ar:6.0.0.301 Android版本场景化接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:sdk:6.0.0.301 Android版本场景化接口Full-SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:full-sdk:6.0.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-foundation:6.0.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口SDK扩展包：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-fluid-extension:6.0.0.301 Android版本2D流体模拟接口数学库：com.huawei.scenekit:scenekit-iphysics-utils:6.0.0.301 **新增特性** * 新增原子化接口物理引擎组件用于场景中的物体模拟真实场景中的物理效果，如碰撞、自由下落等。 * 新增物理引擎2D流体模拟功能，支撑手机主题壁纸需求："通过摇晃手机实现流体晃动的效果，且锁屏壁纸和桌面壁纸都可以有这种效果"。 * 新增物理引擎世界类[PhysicsWorld](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-physicsworld-0000001143302401)，新增刚体组件[RigidBody](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-rigidbody-0000001096382446)、碰撞体组件[Collider](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-collider-0000001096542434)。 * 新增形状类：长方体[BoxShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-boxshape-0000001096062624)、胶囊体[CapsuleShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-capsuleshape-0000001142982443)、圆锥体[ConeShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-coneshape-0000001096222446)、圆柱体[CylinderShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-cylindershape-0000001142862485)、球体[SphereShape](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-sphereshape-0000001143302403)。 * 新增约束组件类：固定约束[FixedConstraint](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-fixedconstraint-0000001096542436)、点对点约束[Point2PointConstraint](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-point2pointconstraint-0000001143182401)、铰链约束[HingeConstraint](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-hingeconstraint-0000001096062626)、圆锥体旋转约束[ConeTwistConstraint](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-conetwistconstraint-0000001142982445)、通用6自由度约束[Generic6DOFConstraint](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-generic6dofconstraint-0000001096222448)、弹簧约束[SpringConstraint](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-springconstraint-0000001142862487)。 * 新增流体场景管理类[SceneKitFluid](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-scenekitfluid-0000001117457606)、物理世界类[World](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-world-0000001163897341)、刚体类[Body](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-body-0000001117457608)、粒子系统类[ParticleSystem](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-particlesystem-0000001163817377)、粒子组类[ParticleGroup](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/api-particlegroup-0000001117617506)。 * 新增[离线简模插件](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/graphics-References/slimmesh-overview-0000001071332125)，用于精简模型网格。|

